00:00:00.120 --> 00:00:08.369
<v Narrator>Ni akọkọ, gbogbo awọn iṣiro jẹ iṣẹlẹ ti ara ẹni nibiti fifin awọn swichi silicon n lo agbara gidi ni joules.

2
